---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
    title="The Journey | The River Kept Flowing"
    description="The Journey follows the unfolding direction of The River Kept Flowing: faith, family, work, stewardship, creation, service, and the lifelong process of becoming."
>
<main>


        <header class="journey-hero">

            <div class="journey-hero-content">

                <p class="eyebrow">
                    A life still unfolding
                </p>

                <h1>
                    The river is not taking me toward a finished life.
                </h1>

                <p class="journey-hero-lead">
                    It is carrying me deeper into responsibility, faith, family,
                    creation, service, and the long work of becoming someone
                    capable of using a life well.
                </p>

                <div class="journey-hero-actions">

                    <a href="#where-i-am-going" class="button journey-button-primary">
                        See Where I Am Going
                    </a>

                    <a href="#milestones" class="button journey-button-secondary">
                        View the Milestones
                    </a>

                </div>

            </div>

        </header>


        <section class="journey-opening">

            <div class="reading-shell">

                <p class="section-label">
                    The story being written in real time
                </p>

                <h2>
                    I do not know every place the river will carry me.
                </h2>

                <p class="journey-opening-lead">
                    I know the direction I want my life to move.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I want to become a faithful husband, an attentive father,
                    a disciplined builder, a trustworthy steward, a capable
                    provider, and a person whose work creates more life than it
                    consumes.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I want to build businesses, books, systems, resources, and
                    communities that serve people beyond the limits of my own
                    time and attention.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I want to understand money without worshiping it, influence
                    without being corrupted by it, work without being enslaved
                    by it, and faith without reducing it to language that never
                    changes the way I live.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The Journey is not a promise that every goal will happen
                    exactly as imagined.
                </p>

                <p>
                    It is a record of the direction I am choosing while remaining
                    open to the possibility that God may redirect the river.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-path-behind">

            <div class="section-shell">

                <div class="journey-section-heading">

                    <p class="section-label light-label">
                        The path behind
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        Every part of the river has prepared the next.
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        The pages behind this one explain the foundation,
                        the beginning, and the present season.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="journey-past-grid">


                    <article class="journey-past-card">

                        <span class="journey-card-number">
                            01
                        </span>

                        <p class="journey-card-type">
                            The foundation
                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            Headwaters
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            The beliefs, questions, values, and purpose beneath
                            the platform.
                        </p>

                        <a href="/headwaters/" class="journey-text-link">
                            Visit Headwaters
                            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-past-card">

                        <span class="journey-card-number">
                            02
                        </span>

                        <p class="journey-card-type">
                            The beginning
                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            The Source
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            The memories, experiences, ambitions, losses, and
                            lessons that shaped the person entering this journey.
                        </p>

                        <a href="/source/" class="journey-text-link">
                            Read the Story
                            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-past-card">

                        <span class="journey-card-number">
                            03
                        </span>

                        <p class="journey-card-type">
                            The present
                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            The Current
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            What I am building, learning, questioning, creating,
                            and carrying right now.
                        </p>

                        <a href="/current/" class="journey-text-link">
                            Enter the Current
                            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>

                    </article>


                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-direction" id="where-i-am-going">

            <div class="section-shell journey-direction-grid">

                <div class="journey-direction-heading">

                    <p class="section-label">
                        Where I am going
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        I am building toward freedom with responsibility.
                    </h2>

                </div>


                <div class="journey-direction-body">

                    <p class="journey-direction-lead">
                        I do not want freedom merely so nobody can tell me what to do.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        I want freedom so I can choose what deserves my life.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        I want enough control over my income, environment, and
                        schedule to remain present with my family, continue
                        learning, create meaningful work, serve people directly,
                        and respond when God places a need in front of me.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        I want work that supports life instead of requiring life
                        to be sacrificed in order to maintain it.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        I want to move from chasing opportunities to creating
                        systems, ideas, and work that naturally attract the people
                        they are meant to serve.
                    </p>

                    <blockquote class="journey-quote">
                        The destination is not escape from responsibility.
                        It is the ability to carry responsibility without surrendering
                        everything else that makes life meaningful.
                    </blockquote>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-pillars">

            <div class="section-shell">

                <div class="journey-section-heading journey-pillars-heading">

                    <p class="section-label light-label">
                        The path ahead
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        These are the directions shaping the journey.
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        They are not isolated goals. Each one changes the meaning
                        and weight of the others.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="journey-pillars-grid">


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            01
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Faithfulness
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Continue learning Scripture, listening carefully,
                            living with conviction, rejecting noise, and becoming
                            more obedient in the ordinary decisions that shape a life.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            02
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Marriage
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Build a marriage marked by peace, safety, honesty,
                            affection, shared direction, and the kind of stability
                            that allows both people to breathe.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            03
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Fatherhood
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Raise two sons with presence, discipline, courage,
                            curiosity, faith, practical ability, emotional security,
                            and a clear understanding that they are deeply loved.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            04
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Financial Freedom
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Build income, ownership, investments, businesses, and
                            systems that eventually return time to my family instead
                            of requiring every available hour to survive.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            05
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Insurance Ownership
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Develop the knowledge and infrastructure necessary to
                            create property and casualty, life-insurance, and
                            financial-services brokerages built around education,
                            service, and long-term trust.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            06
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Market Mastery
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Study trading, currency markets, charting, risk,
                            patience, and execution until ambition is supported
                            by genuine discipline and skill.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            07
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Publication
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Turn this website, the video series, the autobiography,
                            future books, letters, and guides into a body of work
                            capable of serving people long after the original moment.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            08
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Physical Capability
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Return to a body prepared for endurance, protection,
                            movement, work, fatherhood, adventure, boxing,
                            kickboxing, and a long life of active service.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            09
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            A Different Home
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Move toward a place with clean water, fertile land,
                            abundant food, natural beauty, access to fishing and
                            foraging, and an environment that supports the life
                            my family wants to live.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            10
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Community Service
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Build the capacity to feed people, respond to immediate
                            needs, care for those overlooked by systems, and create
                            local forms of service rooted in dignity rather than display.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            11
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Useful Teaching
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Transform lessons from sales, leadership, insurance,
                            food, health, faith, business, communication, and life
                            into guidance people can actually apply.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-pillar-card">

                        <span>
                            12
                        </span>

                        <h3>
                            Legacy
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Leave my family more than money: a record of who I was,
                            what I learned, what I believed, how I failed, how I
                            returned, and what I tried to build for those downstream.
                        </p>

                    </article>


                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-milestones" id="milestones">

            <div class="section-shell">

                <div class="journey-section-heading">

                    <p class="section-label">
                        Milestones along the river
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        Progress deserves to be remembered.
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        This timeline will continue growing as plans become work,
                        work becomes evidence, and evidence becomes part of the story.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="journey-timeline">


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item completed">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span>✓</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                Completed
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                The domain was claimed
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                The River Kept Flowing moved from an idea into a
                                named place with a permanent address.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item completed">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span>✓</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                Completed
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                The website went live
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Hosting, DNS, SSL, analytics, lead capture, and the
                                first working version of the platform were established.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item completed">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span>✓</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                Completed
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                The narrative foundation was built
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Headwaters, The Source, and The Current became the
                                opening structure of a life organized as a flowing story.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item active">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span>•</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                In progress
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                Publish 365 videos
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Build a complete year of consistent public reflection
                                across faith, family, stewardship, leadership,
                                philosophy, health, food, work, and becoming.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item active">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span>•</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                In progress
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                Publish the first two books
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Develop the autobiography and book of belief into
                                completed works capable of standing beyond the website.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item active">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span>•</span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                In progress
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                Welcome a second son
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Protect the health of my wife, prepare our home,
                                welcome our son, and grow into the greater weight
                                of leading a family of four.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item future">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                Ahead
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                Launch an independent brokerage
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Build an insurance operation with ownership,
                                responsible systems, strong carrier relationships,
                                and a client experience centered on education and trust.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item future">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                Ahead
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                Create the first ministry project
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Begin a repeatable form of direct community care
                                focused on food, practical help, dignity, and service
                                beyond institutional boundaries.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-timeline-item future">

                        <div class="journey-timeline-marker">
                            <span></span>
                        </div>

                        <div class="journey-timeline-content">

                            <p class="journey-timeline-status">
                                Ahead
                            </p>

                            <h3>
                                Move my family closer to abundance
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Find a healthier place to live with clean water,
                                fertile land, natural food sources, and room for
                                a different kind of life.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-uncertainty">

            <div class="reading-shell">

                <p class="section-label light-label">
                    What I cannot plan
                </p>

                <h2>
                    Direction does not eliminate uncertainty.
                </h2>

                <p class="journey-uncertainty-lead">
                    Some parts of this journey carry real grief before they even happen.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I think about where my family may live in the future and what
                    moving away could cost.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I think about the people who have become close to us and whether
                    choosing a different environment means watching them grow old
                    from far away.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I think about the tension between building a healthier future
                    for my wife and children and remaining close to the people whose
                    lives are already connected to ours.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I do not have a clean answer.
                </p>

                <p>
                    The Journey must leave room for that.
                </p>

                <blockquote class="journey-uncertainty-quote">
                    Every path chosen closes the distance to one life while creating
                    distance from another.
                </blockquote>

                <p>
                    I want to make those decisions carefully, without allowing fear
                    to imprison my family or ambition to make me careless with love.
                </p>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-philosophy">

            <div class="section-shell journey-philosophy-grid">

                <div class="journey-philosophy-heading">

                    <p class="section-label">
                        The philosophy of the journey
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        Becoming matters more than arriving.
                    </h2>

                </div>


                <div class="journey-principles">


                    <article class="journey-principle">

                        <span>
                            01
                        </span>

                        <div>

                            <h3>
                                The process is part of the inheritance.
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                I do not want my sons to inherit only the result.
                                I want them to understand what it required, what
                                it cost, what failed, and what made continuing possible.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-principle">

                        <span>
                            02
                        </span>

                        <div>

                            <h3>
                                A changed direction is not always a failed plan.
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                The river can still be faithful to its source while
                                moving around terrain it could not pass through directly.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-principle">

                        <span>
                            03
                        </span>

                        <div>

                            <h3>
                                Capacity must grow with opportunity.
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Receiving more without becoming stronger, wiser,
                                and more disciplined can turn a blessing into another
                                form of destruction.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-principle">

                        <span>
                            04
                        </span>

                        <div>

                            <h3>
                                Peace is not the absence of meaningful work.
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Peace is being able to work without losing the people,
                                convictions, health, and purpose the work was meant
                                to protect.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-principle">

                        <span>
                            05
                        </span>

                        <div>

                            <h3>
                                Enough must eventually be defined.
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Without a definition of enough, every achievement
                                becomes permission to demand more from life without
                                ever learning how to receive it.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-principle">

                        <span>
                            06
                        </span>

                        <div>

                            <h3>
                                The journey should serve more than the traveler.
                            </h3>

                            <p>
                                Whatever I build should eventually create food,
                                knowledge, opportunity, protection, freedom, dignity,
                                or hope for someone besides me.
                            </p>

                        </div>

                    </article>


                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-invitation">

            <div class="journey-invitation-overlay">

                <div class="reading-shell">

                    <p class="section-label light-label">
                        An invitation
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        You do not have to arrive before your life becomes worth documenting.
                    </h2>

                    <p class="journey-invitation-lead">
                        Most meaningful lives are built where nobody can yet see
                        what they are becoming.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        They are built in ordinary rooms, difficult jobs, unfinished
                        plans, repeated conversations, quiet decisions, interrupted
                        sleep, small acts of courage, and years that do not look
                        impressive from the outside.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        This page exists to remember that the middle matters.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        The uncertainty matters.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        The work beneath the visible result matters.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Wherever you entered the river, you are already somewhere
                        in the story.
                    </p>

                    <blockquote class="journey-invitation-quote">
                        The invitation is not to copy my path. It is to become more
                        intentional about the one beneath your own feet.
                    </blockquote>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-follow">

            <div class="section-shell">

                <div class="journey-section-heading">

                    <p class="section-label">
                        Walk the river
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        Follow the work as it continues downstream.
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        The story continues through present reflections, letters,
                        videos, guides, and the different tributaries feeding the
                        larger work.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="journey-follow-grid">


                    <article class="journey-follow-card journey-follow-featured">

                        <p class="journey-follow-type">
                            Right now
                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            Enter The Current
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            See what I am building, learning, questioning, and
                            carrying in this present season.
                        </p>

                        <a href="/current/" class="journey-text-link light-text-link">
                            Follow the Current
                            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-follow-card">

                        <p class="journey-follow-type">
                            Personal writing
                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            Letters From the River
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Read deeper reflections written directly to the people
                            walking through similar questions, seasons, and struggles.
                        </p>

                        <a href="/letters-from-the-river/" class="journey-text-link">
                            Read the Letters
                            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-follow-card">

                        <p class="journey-follow-type">
                            Practical teaching
                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            River Guides
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Explore lessons and resources created from experience
                            in faith, work, stewardship, health, family, business,
                            communication, and becoming.
                        </p>

                        <a href="/river-guides/" class="journey-text-link">
                            Explore the Guides
                            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>

                    </article>


                    <article class="journey-follow-card">

                        <p class="journey-follow-type">
                            The many streams
                        </p>

                        <h3>
                            Tributaries
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Enter the different areas of life feeding this platform:
                            faith, family, business, food, health, philosophy,
                            financial education, and service.
                        </p>

                        <a href="/tributaries/" class="journey-text-link">
                            Explore the Tributaries
                            <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>

                    </article>


                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section class="journey-final">

            <div class="reading-shell">

                <p class="section-label">
                    The next bend
                </p>

                <h2>
                    I cannot see the whole river from here.
                </h2>

                <p>
                    I can only remain faithful with the part in front of me.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Build what I can build.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Learn what I need to learn.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Love the people I have been given.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Carry the responsibility already in my hands.
                </p>

                <p>
                    And continue moving when the next part of the path becomes clear.
                </p>

                <blockquote class="journey-final-quote">
                    The river kept flowing not because it knew every turn,
                    but because it continued responding to the ground beneath it.
                </blockquote>

                <div class="page-actions">

                    <a href="/letters-from-the-river/" class="button page-button-primary">
                        Read the Letters
                    </a>

                    <a href="/river-guides/" class="button page-button-secondary">
                        Explore River Guides
                    </a>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


    </main>

</MainLayout>
